# Environment variables

Copy values into your shell or a local `.env` loader. Do **not** commit real secrets.

```bash
# Runtime
export SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=postgres   # h2 | postgres | mysql
export SERVER_PORT=8080

# JWT
export JWT_SECRET='replace-with-a-long-random-secret-at-least-32-chars'
export JWT_EXPIRATION_MS=86400000

# Database (postgres / mysql)
export DB_HOST=localhost
export DB_PORT=5432          # 3306 for MySQL
export DB_NAME=bookingdb
export DB_USERNAME=postgres
export DB_PASSWORD=postgres
```
